    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose dinku'uumár múk Israeli sleémeero gari dinkwár i ateét, giri báy, «Muruuwí an kudaádá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa alqadín dirhúng i ale as kuungá' kuwa tlehha'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelo lahhooe gadiyérhúng tleehhaak, ala bál faanqw a deelór hhoohhoo' ar Sabaáto ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar kuungá' tawa hungu/usa'. Umuúqo heewo oo gadiyeé gaa tleehh baalaarihe aqo kun gaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asla a oohisa'aaká baraá marayhunge deelór Sabaátoro.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Mose iri axweés dír dinku'uumár múk Israeli, giri báy, «Muruuwí an kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa hara'ayín, iwa kaahi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohmér ni hanisa' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngin baraá daqaari'iimarhúng wa duxá'. Umuúqo heé muunuú sla'aari gu koóm, gár i haniisi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngi huwi. Ohmér ni hanisa' a tí: Sahaábu nee muqslár peésa, nee muqslár sirda/aten, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee neewór taa tleéhh ar se'éngw bee/aangw ar kaloó sirboó/, nee ar sirda/aten, nee ar da/aten, nee kitaánír hhohho', nee neewór se'éngw aara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kadaá gwaandaawe awa taa da/teemiís, nee kadaá aara, nee peehhoó masqaryaán, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee di/tá tsaa'asi, nee muruudá' ta di/tá iimbalaxángwár aleedogiiti, nee mooyangwdá' tsuú' ta d/a/aa/an, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee tlaa/aá tlaxo gawden awa ta bay sardoniki, nee tlaa/aá tlaxo gawden awa hatlá' awa ta qaasi gawaá naifeéra, nee gawaá tlakoó da/eewo.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Umuúqo heewo dirhunge oo xu'utír muruuko tlehhit ga koóm ni hardihi, nee muruuwí sleémeero oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa oó' ngu tleehhi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heémár Mungú nee tuuntukumaarose, nee inqwaaridár afkú do' kur tuuntuuki, nee dungáywose, nee uheemiwose nee yukmi'iiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sandakmoodá' nee xaa'aá kur loohisi, nee kitangwduú gurtleemu nee inqwaaridár tuuntuuka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee meésadá' nee xaaiiwós kudá' kar loohisi, nee xosluuwós sleémeero, nee mikaáteedár Munguhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kitángw tsaa'aso iwa gwa/at nee xosluuwose, nee tsaa'aso nee di/tá tsaa'aso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kitángw ilahhooár mooyángw tsuú' kuwa da/a/an, nee xaaiiwós awa kur loohisi, nee di/tá iimbalaxaangw nee mooyángw tsuú', nee inqwaarír afkú heémár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kitángw ilahhooár da/a/aangw kawa hanmiisi, nee muqslír sirdaa/aat ar tsiiriihh, nee xaa'aá kur loohisi, nee xosluuwós sleémeero, nee iimpeedár hamtlo nee kitaangose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee inqwarudá' tsiiriíhh taa afeenadár harweér nee uheemi'ine, nee yukumayduú uheemiwo, nee inqwaarír afkú afeena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kika'ár heémár Mungú, nee kika'ár afeena nee him'eerose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee tlabaadá' taa hiriít ar parooti as kiwa ar gadiyuusi didá' hhoohhoó' wa alé. Hiyoó hhoohhoó' as Aroni kudú kaahamusmoó Mungú, nee hiya'aá hhohho' as daaqoó Aroni asma gadiyér'ín ar kahamuusi'iima.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo muu sleémeero oo xoorór Israeli tari diya/aát dír ilaá Mosewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindiri hardáh umuúqo heewo oo muunaáwós i tliwii/in, nee umuúqo heewo oo qeeruuwós taa sla'atís, inooín ohme kingiri huúw amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ as gadiyér heémadár Mungú nee as sagadiyuusi'iimarós, nee as tlabaadá' hhohho'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhawaate nee /ameenaaro kudá' sleémeero muner'ín taa tliwií/ niri hardihiyé', kipi'i ngiri huwiyé' nee muqslár ta bay hasama, nee mungiaá ta dugeenír qamin, nee himtaawe, nee xooslaá taa tleéhh ar sahaábu. Umuúqo heewo xooslaá taa tleéhh ar sahaábu giri haniís dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heewo oo neewór sirbo/ ar se'éngw bee/aangw ga koóm ngina huúw, nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten, nee kitaánír hhohho' nee se'éngw aara, nee kadaá gwaandaawe awa taa da/ateemiís, nee kudaá taa natsatsaeemiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heé peésa ga duuxi laqaá muqsladá' sirdaa/aten aqo gana ilahhooár wa huúw dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Nee umuúqo heé masqaryaandi ga qo kooma, aqo ngina huúw as gadiyérka ngiwa ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee /ameena sleémeero ar gadiyér daba' ga aleesláw, muruuín kudá' naa tlatlawiné' nguri huwiyé', neewór sirbo/ ar se'éngw bee/aangw nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten nee ar kitaánír hhohhoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee /ameena sleémeero ar tlaatlawiingw gu aleeslaw, nee ar muunaáwí gu koom, se'éngw aara nguri tlaatlawiné'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuuse sleeme tlaa/aá ta bay sardoniki nee awa hatlae kingina huúw as kiwa hiriiti gawaá naifeéra, nee gawaá tlakwayduú da/eewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruudá' taa mooyángw ar tlehhahhiiti nguna huwiyé' sleeme, nee di/tá tsaa'aso nee di/tá iimbalaxaangw, nee mooyángw tsuú'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli sleémeero, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro kudá' muner'ín aa qwala/ as gaa ngiwa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i haniisi, umuúqo heé muunaáwós taa sla'atís, muruuwós guri huúw ar muunuú /awaák as adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngwa bay kawa tleehhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
