          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Mose múk Israeli guri báy, «Ga/aawaak, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Besaleli garmoó Uri, nángw naangoó Huri oo tlahhoó Yuda gwa tsawaár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kwa hatsiís qeeruú Munguhe, as aleesleemu nee fuquraangw nee xu'uti ngiwa slay as gadiyér umuúqo adooro ngiwa aleeslay tleehhamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As kahhó' gadiyér xuaawasl ngiwa aleeslay tleehharo ar sahaábu nguwa kwahhuuti nee peésa nee muqslár sirdaa/atene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kahhó' tlaa/eedá' tlaxo gawden ngiwa aleeslay dakooro, nee xaai ngiwa aleeslay parootiro, nee gadiyér umuúqo daa'awto ngiwa tleehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kwa sagalooár i haniís dinkwa nee Oholiabu garmoó Ahisamaki oo tlahhoó Dani, as múk hatlá' kuwa intsaahhatimiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí tsaraawo kwa hatsiís sagalooaro, as gadiyér umuúqo daa'awto ngiwa tleehhiya', gadiyér tlaa/e parootusa nee gadiyér fuqurángw slaa', gadiyér parootír neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/ nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten, nee kitaánidá' hhohho' ar taa hhuútl, nee gadiyér tlaba' tlehhit, nee umuúqo daa'awtá gadiyeede, nee daa'awtá gadiyér xuaawaslen.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
